Help us help you faster

When you contact us about an order, please share:

your name and the phone number or email used at checkout;
your Razorpay payment ID (it is in your payment confirmation SMS or email);
a short description of your question or problem.

If you need to correct a birth detail, write to us as soon as possible, before your report is prepared. See Your birth details in our Terms.

